{
  "lessonId": "L2M2L2",
  "title": "Umbria 翁布里亞",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad 0%,#9b59b6 100%)'><h1>🍇 Umbria</h1><p class='subtitle'>Sagrantino 的力量與綠色心臟</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>💚 義大利的綠色心臟</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Umbria（翁布里亞）是義大利唯一<strong>沒有海岸線的中部大區</strong>，被稱為<strong>「義大利的綠色心臟」</strong>（Cuore Verde d'Italia）。</p><p class='highlight'>Umbria 以<strong>Sagrantino di Montefalco</strong>（義大利單寧最高的紅酒之一）和<strong>Orvieto 白酒</strong>聞名。</p></div><div class='umbria-facts'><div class='fact-box'><div class='fact-icon'>🏔️</div><div class='fact-text'>丘陵地形為主<br>海拔 200-500m</div></div><div class='fact-box'><div class='fact-icon'>🌳</div><div class='fact-text'>森林覆蓋率高<br>自然生態豐富</div></div><div class='fact-box'><div class='fact-icon'>🍷</div><div class='fact-text'>2 DOCG<br>13 DOC</div></div><div class='fact-box'><div class='fact-icon'>🏛️</div><div class='fact-text'>歷史名城<br>Assisi, Perugia</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Sagrantino - 義大利的單寧之王</h2><div class='sagrantino-section'><div class='sagrantino-intro'><h3>💪 世界上單寧含量最高的葡萄品種之一</h3><p>Sagrantino 是 Umbria 獨有的紅葡萄品種，<strong>單寧含量極高、酒體強勁、陳年潛力驚人</strong>，與 Barolo、Barbaresco 齊名。</p><div class='tannin-comparison'><h4>單寧含量比較（mg/L）</h4><div class='tannin-bars'><div class='tannin-bar sagrantino'><span>Sagrantino</span><div class='bar' style='width:100%'>5000-6000</div></div><div class='tannin-bar nebbiolo'><span>Nebbiolo</span><div class='bar' style='width:65%'>3000-4000</div></div><div class='tannin-bar cabernet'><span>Cabernet Sauvignon</span><div class='bar' style='width:50%'>2500-3000</div></div><div class='tannin-bar sangiovese'><span>Sangiovese</span><div class='bar' style='width:45%'>2000-2500</div></div></div></div></div><div class='sagrantino-docg'><h3>Sagrantino di Montefalco DOCG</h3><div class='docg-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Montefalco 小鎮周圍</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Sagrantino（100%）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>極濃郁、高單寧、高酒精度（14-16%）</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、李子、皮革、巧克力、野味、香料</p><p><strong>陳年要求：</strong>33 個月（含 12 個月橡木桶）</p><p><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>15-30 年</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Sagrantino 的兩種風格</h2><div class='sagrantino-styles'><div class='style-card dry'><h3>🍇 Sagrantino di Montefalco Secco</h3><div class='style-details'><p class='style-badge dry-badge'>不甜 Dry</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>現代主流版本</p><p><strong>釀造：</strong>傳統發酵、橡木桶陳年</p><p><strong>單寧：</strong>極高、堅實、需陳年軟化</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>14-16%</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑色水果、皮革、煙草、巧克力、香料</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>野味（野豬、鹿）、烤紅肉、陳年 Pecorino 起司</p><p><strong>適飲期：</strong>釀造後 5-10 年，可陳年 30 年</p></div></div><div class='style-card sweet'><h3>🍇 Sagrantino di Montefalco Passito</h3><div class='style-details'><p class='style-badge sweet-badge'>甜型 Sweet</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>傳統古老版本</p><p><strong>釀造：</strong>葡萄風乾（Appassimento）後發酵</p><p><strong>風乾時間：</strong>2-3 個月</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>50-100 g/L</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>乾果、無花果、黑巧克力、咖啡、甘草、葡萄乾</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>巧克力甜點、藍紋起司、堅果塔</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>歷史上用於宗教儀式（名字來自 Sacro - 神聖）</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⚪ Orvieto DOC - Umbria 的經典白酒</h2><div class='orvieto-section'><div class='orvieto-intro'><h3>🏰 古城 Orvieto 的白酒傳統</h3><p>Orvieto 是 Umbria 最知名的白酒產區，歷史可追溯至<strong>Etruscan 文明</strong>（公元前 8 世紀）。</p></div><div class='orvieto-details'><div class='orvieto-card'><h4>🍇 品種組成</h4><ul><li><strong>Grechetto</strong> 40-60%（主導品種）</li><li><strong>Trebbiano Toscano</strong> 15-25%</li><li><strong>Verdello、Canaiolo Bianco、Malvasia</strong>（可選）</li></ul></div><div class='orvieto-card'><h4>🍷 風格類型</h4><p><strong>Secco（不甜）：</strong>主流版本</p><p>風味：白花、青蘋果、杏仁、礦物</p><p>風格：清爽、中等酒體</p><hr><p><strong>Abboccato（微甜）：</strong>傳統風格</p><p>風味：蜂蜜、杏桃、白花</p><p>殘糖：10-30 g/L</p><hr><p><strong>Classico：</strong>核心產區，品質更高</p><p><strong>Superiore：</strong>陳年 12 個月，12% 酒精度</p></div><div class='orvieto-card'><h4>🍽️ 配餐</h4><ul><li>🐟 淡水魚（Umbria 多河流湖泊）</li><li>🍝 Carbonara 培根蛋麵</li><li>🍄 松露料理（Umbria 產黑松露）</li><li>🧀 新鮮起司</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Montefalco Rosso DOC</h2><div class='montefalco-rosso'><div class='rosso-intro'><h3>🍇 Sagrantino 的「小弟」</h3><p>Montefalco Rosso 使用<strong>Sangiovese + Sagrantino</strong>混釀，比 Sagrantino di Montefalco 更易飲、價格更親民，是<strong>了解 Sagrantino 風格的入門酒款</strong>。</p></div><div class='rosso-details'><table><tr><th>項目</th><th>Montefalco Rosso DOC</th><th>Sagrantino di Montefalco DOCG</th></tr><tr><td><strong>品種</strong></td><td>Sangiovese 60-70%<br>Sagrantino 10-15%<br>其他品種</td><td>Sagrantino 100%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>風格</strong></td><td>中等至飽滿酒體<br>單寧中等</td><td>飽滿酒體<br>極高單寧</td></tr><tr><td><strong>陳年要求</strong></td><td>無<br>Riserva: 30 個月</td><td>33 個月<br>（含 12 個月橡木桶）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酒精度</strong></td><td>12-13%</td><td>14-16%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>適飲期</strong></td><td>即飲 - 5 年</td><td>5-30 年</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格</strong></td><td>€€</td><td>€€€-€€€€</td></tr></table></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 其他 Umbria 葡萄酒</h2><div class='other-wines'><div class='wine-card'><h3>Torgiano Rosso Riserva DOCG</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Perugia 附近的 Torgiano</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Sangiovese（70-100%），可混 Canaiolo</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>優雅、結構良好、陳年潛力佳</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>由 Lungarotti 酒莊推廣至世界</p><p><strong>陳年：</strong>3 年（含橡木桶）</p></div></div><div class='wine-card'><h3>Grechetto（單一品種酒）</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Grechetto（100%）</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Umbria 全區</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>果香豐富、酒體飽滿、杏仁香氣</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白桃、杏桃、杏仁、礦物</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>比 Orvieto 混釀更濃郁</p></div></div><div class='wine-card'><h3>Umbria IGT</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>特點：</strong>允許國際品種（Merlot、Cabernet、Chardonnay）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>現代化、果香濃郁</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Cervaro della Sala（Chardonnay + Grechetto，Antinori 出品）</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Umbria 美食文化</h2><div class='cuisine-section'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🌳 森林資源與樸實料理</h3><p>Umbria 的料理以<strong>黑松露、野味、淡水魚、豆類</strong>為特色，風格樸實、食材優質。</p></div><div class='food-pairing'><div class='pairing-card'><h4>Sagrantino 配餐</h4><ul><li>🦌 野豬（Cinghiale）燉肉</li><li>🥩 炭烤 T-bone 牛排</li><li>🍖 鹿肉、兔肉</li><li>🧀 陳年 Pecorino 起司</li><li>🍄 黑松露料理</li><li>🍝 野豬肉醬義大利麵</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>Orvieto 配餐</h4><ul><li>🐟 湖魚料理（Trasimeno 湖）</li><li>🍝 Carbonara 培根蛋麵</li><li>🍄 白松露義大利麵</li><li>🧀 新鮮 Mozzarella</li><li>🥗 沙拉、蔬菜</li><li>🍗 白肉料理</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>Montefalco Rosso 配餐</h4><ul><li>🍖 烤肉、BBQ</li><li>🍝 肉醬義大利麵</li><li>🍕 Pizza</li><li>🧀 中等陳年起司</li><li>🍄 野菇燉飯</li><li>🥘 燉豆料理</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Umbria 被稱為「義大利的綠色心臟」，唯一沒有海岸線的中部大區</div><div class='point'>✓ Sagrantino 是世界上單寧含量最高的葡萄品種之一（5000-6000 mg/L）</div><div class='point'>✓ Sagrantino di Montefalco 有 Secco（不甜）和 Passito（甜型）兩種風格</div><div class='point'>✓ Orvieto 是 Umbria 最知名的白酒，歷史可追溯至 Etruscan 文明</div><div class='point'>✓ Montefalco Rosso（Sangiovese + Sagrantino）是了解 Sagrantino 的入門酒款</div><div class='point'>✓ Sagrantino 適合野味、烤紅肉，陳年潛力 15-30 年</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#f4ecf7);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #8e44ad;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.umbria-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.fact-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9b59b6,#8e44ad);padding:25px 20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.fact-icon{font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:10px}.fact-text{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.5}.sagrantino-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.sagrantino-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#f4ecf7);border-radius:10px}.sagrantino-intro h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.4rem}.sagrantino-intro>p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.tannin-comparison h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.1rem}.tannin-bars{display:grid;gap:12px}.tannin-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px}.tannin-bar span{min-width:170px;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.tannin-bar .bar{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8e44ad,#9b59b6);color:#fff;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(142,68,173,.3)}.sagrantino-docg{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:6px solid #8e44ad}.sagrantino-docg h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.3rem}.docg-details p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.docg-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.sagrantino-styles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.style-card{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.style-card.dry{border-color:#c0392b}.style-card.sweet{border-color:#e67e22}.style-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem}.style-card.dry h3{color:#c0392b}.style-card.sweet h3{color:#e67e22}.style-badge{display:inline-block;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;color:#fff}.dry-badge{background:#c0392b}.sweet-badge{background:#e67e22}.style-details p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.style-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.orvieto-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.orvieto-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.orvieto-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.4rem}.orvieto-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.orvieto-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.orvieto-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #3498db}.orvieto-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.1rem}.orvieto-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.8}.orvieto-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.orvieto-card hr{border:none;border-top:2px dashed #e0e0e0;margin:15px 0}.orvieto-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.montefalco-rosso{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.rosso-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#fce4ec);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.rosso-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.4rem}.rosso-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.rosso-details table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.rosso-details th{background:#e74c3c;color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:left;font-size:1.05rem}.rosso-details td{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;line-height:1.6;vertical-align:top}.rosso-details tr:hover{background:#fef5e7}.rosso-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.other-wines{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.wine-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid #9b59b6}.wine-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#9b59b6;font-size:1.2rem}.wine-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.wine-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.cuisine-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cuisine-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5f4e6,#eafaf1);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.cuisine-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.3rem}.cuisine-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.food-pairing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.pairing-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #8e44ad}.pairing-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem;text-align:center}.pairing-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.pairing-card li{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8daef,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
